@page "/"
@layout MarketingLayout

<PageTitle>My Active Vitals | See your health more clearly</PageTitle>

<section class="marketing-hero">
    <div>
        <p class="marketing-kicker">Your health story, in one place</p>
        <h1>See the patterns behind how you feel.</h1>
        <p class="marketing-hero__lead">
            My Active Vitals brings nutrition, activity, vital readings, kidney labs, and personal trends together so you can understand your day-to-day health with less guesswork.
        </p>
        <div class="marketing-hero__actions">
            <a class="marketing-button marketing-button--primary" href="pricing">View plans</a>
            <a class="marketing-button marketing-button--outline" href="features">Explore features</a>
        </div>
        <p class="marketing-trust-note">Seven-day trial planned · Payment method required · Cancel anytime</p>
    </div>

    <div class="marketing-dashboard-preview" aria-label="Sample health dashboard">
        <div class="marketing-dashboard-preview__top">
            <span>Today’s overview</span>
            <span class="marketing-dashboard-preview__status">On track</span>
        </div>
        <div class="marketing-preview-grid">
            <div class="marketing-preview-card">
                <span>Blood pressure</span>
                <strong>118/76</strong>
                <small>Latest reading</small>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-preview-card">
                <span>Nutrition</span>
                <strong>1,640 cal</strong>
                <small>Daily total</small>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-preview-card">
                <span>Exercise</span>
                <strong>42 min</strong>
                <small>Moderate activity</small>
            </div>
            <div class="marketing-preview-card">
                <span>Weight trend</span>
                <strong>Stable</strong>
                <small>Last seven days</small>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="marketing-section marketing-section--tint">
    <div class="marketing-section__heading">
        <p class="marketing-kicker">Built for everyday awareness</p>
        <h2>More than a logbook.</h2>
        <p>Record the details that matter to you, then turn them into a clearer view of your routines and progress.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="marketing-card-grid marketing-card-grid--four">
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <span class="marketing-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">N</span>
            <h3>Nutrition</h3>
            <p>Track meals, calories, sodium, potassium, protein, phosphorus, fluids, and binders.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <span class="marketing-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
            <h3>Exercise</h3>
            <p>Capture workouts, duration, intensity, and estimated calories burned.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <span class="marketing-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">V</span>
            <h3>Health tracking</h3>
            <p>Keep blood pressure, glucose, weight, fluid intake, and kidney lab history together.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <span class="marketing-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
            <h3>Analytics</h3>
            <p>Review daily totals, recent trends, and longer-term patterns without rebuilding spreadsheets.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="marketing-section">
    <div class="marketing-section__heading">
        <p class="marketing-kicker">Designed around real life</p>
        <h2>Useful for the appointment—and every day between.</h2>
        <p>My Active Vitals is for adults who want a more organized record of their personal health, including people managing kidney-conscious nutrition and multiple daily health measurements.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="marketing-card-grid">
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <h3>Capture quickly</h3>
            <p>Simple entry screens help you record readings and meals while the details are fresh.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <h3>Review confidently</h3>
            <p>See entries in context instead of searching across notebooks, apps, and disconnected files.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="marketing-card">
            <h3>Share better context</h3>
            <p>Bring organized personal records to conversations with your care team while keeping medical decisions with qualified professionals.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="marketing-cta">
    <h2>Ready for a clearer daily picture?</h2>
    <p>Explore the complete feature set and choose the plan that fits how you want to track.</p>
    <a class="marketing-button" href="pricing">See pricing</a>
</section>
